# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Panther Mastery (193), Raptor Mastery (197), Nothing But The Truth (1372), The Gurubashi Legends of Old (95748),
# Locating the Lost City (95770, Kin'weelay's next legend: the cavern entrance under the Vile Reef, west of Grom'gol, on
# the way to the jungle stalkers; handed in with the trophy skulls). Its follow-up, The Drowned City (95775), is a dungeon.
# Excelsior (628, Drizzlik: the Elder Saltwater Crocolisk on the coast between Zul'Kunda and Grom'gol, optional).
# Goblin Sponsorship (1182, fix round 2026-11-20): from Baron Revilgaz on the first Booty Bay stop, for a player who
# brought Gazlowe's letter (1180/1181); Foreman Cozzle's footlocker on the ride north from Grom'gol to Nesingwary (his
# house by Lake Nazferiti, about 9 map units off the road; Cozzle 38, Venture Co. Agents 39, at or under the player at
# 40), handed in on the second Booty Bay stop with 1183 taken for Pozzik at the Mirage Raceway (40-50/02).
# Left out: The Bloodsail Buccaneers (608), taken in forever/horde/40-50/06-azshara at 50.
# Level tidy (0.4.0): the level 43-46 errands are still taken here, where the route passes their givers, and done on
# 40-50/02's Grom'gol stop at about 45, after the Riverglades, where their mobs fit (here they ran 2-4 over the player,
# #2353, #2102): Mok'thardin's Enchantment and Akiris (573, 617), Stranglethorn Fever (348), Voodoo Dues (609), Zanzil's
# Secret (621, Zanzil's camps 43-44) and the Wild Shore (604, 576, 587). Speaking with Gan'zulah (586) is taken at the
# Bubbling Cauldron on 02's Grom'gol landing, right before its Skullsplitters, instead of carried from here; Skullsplitter
# Tusks (209), taken on this guide's Booty Bay stops, is handed in on that stop's Booty Bay call, where Krazek's
# Tran'rek (2864) is taken, so this guide makes no Booty Bay flight of its own for them.
# Riding at 40: the Grom'gol stop after Zul'Kunda (about 41) offers each race's riding trainer by zeppelin, before the
# Riverglades, a zone you cross on foot otherwise.

step Fly to the Undercity
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  tip Your level 40 training is in the Undercity: fly there from Kargath, train, and take the zeppelin from the towers outside the city to Grom'gol.
  fly "Undercity"
  zone Undercity

step Genavie Callow
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  when complete 1164
  zone Undercity
  tip Genavie Callow stands beside the flight master you land at: the Dabyrie heads from the Arathi Highlands.
  turnin 1164                           -- Genavie Callow, beside the flight master

step Undercity trainers
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Undercity
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock

step Riding at 40
  only Undead,Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  when level>=40
  tip Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Velma Warnam in Brill, a short ride north of the zeppelin towers, with Zachariah Post's skeletal horses (20 gold each) beside her. Ride back to the towers for the Grom'gol zeppelin.
  train 4773 optional                   -- Velma Warnam, riding trainer
  note "Skeletal horses: Zachariah Post, beside Velma Warnam in Brill."

step Zeppelin to Grom'gol
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  goto 61.8,59.2 "Zeppelin to Grom'gol"

step Fly to Grom'gol
  only Hunter,Shaman,Druid
  zone Badlands
  goto 4.1,44.9 "Kargath flight master"
  fly "Grom'gol"
  zone Stranglethorn Vale

step Grom'gol Base Camp
  turnin 1240                           -- Kin'weelay
  accept 95748 npc 2519                 -- Kin'weelay: the legend lies in Zul'Kunda, where this guide goes for Gan'zulah
  accept 1261                           -- the Bubbling Cauldron beside Kin'weelay: Marg Speaks, for Nazeer Bloodpike in Brackenwall Village on the Dustwallow guide, where the crabs drop the pendant
  accept 598                            -- Kin'weelay: Split Bone Necklace, the trophy skulls stand in the Skullsplitter ruins, on this guide's second loop
  accept 2932                           -- Nimboya: Grim Message, for the Hinterlands, around level 48

step Jungle Stalkers
  tip The Jungle Stalkers (40-41) hunt the coast south of Grom'gol. They are well above you: pull one at a time and rest between fights.
  tip Careful: Tethis, a level 43 elite raptor, roams among the stalkers: leave him for Raptor Mastery's group step.
  collect 3863 quest 572

step Far Seer Mok'thardin
  turnin 572
  accept 571

