# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North through the jungle

step Mistvale gorillas
  when level>=40
  when onquest 571
  when !complete 571
  tip The gorillas roam the valley around Unbagwa. The elders drop the giblets; any of them can drop a fang: if you will take Stranglethorn Fever with a group, keep ten for Unbagwa, whose Mokk (44) waits for your Stranglethorn stop at about 45.
  tip Careful: the Elder Mistvale Gorillas (40-41) stand close together in the valley: pull one at a time.
  loop
  goto 33.03,66.12 map 1434 era r 22
  goto 32.57,66.64 map 1434 era r 22
  collect 2799 x10 npc 1557 optional -- Keep fangs from these same elders for Unbagwa (Stranglethorn Fever, with a group).
  collect 3862 quest 571 @33.0,66.1 map 1434
  collect 3919 quest 606.1 @33.03,66.12 map 1434 era

step Mistvale giblets
  when level>=40
  when onquest 606
  when !complete 606
  collect 3919 quest 606.1 npc 1557 @33.03,66.12 map 1434 era

step Mistvale gorillas at 39
  when level>=39
  when level<40
  when onquest 571,606
  tip Look for lone level 40 elders in this same camp for the sinew and giblets. Leave level 41 gorillas alone; don't stay just for extra fangs.
