  collect 3919 quest 606.1 npc 1557

step Venture Co. mine
  tip Further north, the goblins of the Venture Co. dig at the mine east of the road; miners, foremen, surveyors and tinkerers all drop the crystals.
  tip Careful: Stealthed Shadowmaw Panthers and Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the area around the camp.
  collect 3917 quest 600.1

step Shadowmaw Panthers
  when onquest 192
  tip Panther Mastery is still open: the Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk the jungle north of the mine, towards the Mosh'Ogg hills. They use Sneak, so they show only when you are close: pull them one at a time, and leave the Elder Shadowmaw Panthers (42-43) alone.
  kill 684 quest 192 @41.3,34.8 map 1434

