step Foreman Cozzle's house
  when onquest 1182
  tip On the way north, a short way east of the road: Foreman Cozzle's house stands on the north shore of Lake Nazferiti. Foreman Cozzle (38) carries the key to his footlocker, inside the house; the Venture Co. Agents (39) stand in and around it: pull them one at a time. Then on north-west to Nesingwary's camp.
  collect 5851 "Cozzle's Key" @42.6,18.4 map 1434 -- Foreman Cozzle
  collect 5852 quest 1182.1 @43.3,20.4 map 1434 -- Cozzle's Footlocker, inside the house

