step Whiskey Slim and Fin Fizracket
  when level>=40
  tip Whiskey Slim, in the inn, and "Sea Wolf" MacKinley, on the top floor, offer these quests from level 40: pick them up now. Under 40, the Feralas & Tanaris guide's Booty Bay stop offers them again.
  accept 580                            -- Whiskey Slim, in the inn: his bottles wash up on the Hinterlands coast, around level 48
  accept 2872                           -- MacKinley, on the top floor: Stoley's Debt, for Stoley in Tanaris

step Fin Fizracket
  when level>=40
  when group 348
  tip Group quest: Stranglethorn Fever ends at Witch Doctor Unbagwa in Mistvale. Hand him ten gorilla fangs and he calls three waves of gorillas (41-42), one after another, then Mokk the Savage (44). In players' recordings, 12 of the 27 people who started it died there. Take it if you have a friend or two along.
  accept 348                            -- Fin Fizracket, beside the inn: Unbagwa's part on the Feralas guide's Grom'gol stop

step The Bloodsail ships
  when group 624
  tip The scroll, Cortello's Riddle, lies on the decks of the three ships off the Wild Shore, crewed by pirates of 42-45 who come in pairs, with captains of 45-48: take it with a group. Its chain runs on through the Swamp of Sorrows, Dustwallow Marsh and the Hinterlands.
  collect 4056 "Cortello's Riddle"
  accept 624                            -- for a later stop in the Swamp of Sorrows

step Fly to Grom'gol
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Fly back to Grom'gol: Zul'Mamwe's Skullsplitters are just east of it.
  goto 26.8,77.0 "Booty Bay flight master"
  fly "Grom'gol"

step Zul'Mamwe
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  when level>=39
  when onquest 209,598
  tip The warriors in the northern ruins (39-40) drop both tusks and necklaces. Pull from the edge; leave the chief and his two guards to the south alone.
  collect 1524 quest 209.1 npc 667 @45.06,34.07 map 1434 era
  collect 3916 quest 598.1 npc 667 @45.06,34.07 map 1434 era

step Zul'Mamwe and Balia'mah trophy skulls
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Look for the trophy skulls in the small ruins north of Zul'Mamwe's warriors.
  tip The last skulls are in the ruins a short walk west, on the way back to Grom'gol.
  collect 3908 quest 585.3
  collect 3906 quest 585.1
  collect 3907 quest 585.2

