step Raptor Mastery
  when group 197
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Tethis is a level 43 elite: most classes solo it at level 45, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone.
  collect 3877 quest 197.1 @31.5,41.2 map 1434

