  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Bhag'thera is a level 40 elite: most classes solo it at level 42, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone.
  collect 3876 quest 193.1 @49.4,24.0 map 1434

