# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Swamp of Sorrows

step Into the Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Follow the road east from Duskwood through Deadwind Pass into the swamp. Magtoor waits at the Harborage, the draenei camp just off the road where it comes in from Deadwind Pass.
  accept 1389                           -- Magtoor

step Stonard
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Head east to Stonard, in the reeds south of the road.
  accept 698                            -- Dar, inside
  accept 1430                           -- Dar, inside
  getfp "Stonard" npc 6026              -- Breyk
  turnin 1420                           -- Helgrum the Swift, upstairs
  accept 1424                           -- Fel'zerul, on the top floor

step Sawtooth crocolisks
  tip The crocolisks wallow in the pools around Galen's camp and south towards Stonard; about one in four drops a flank.
  collect 6169 quest 698.1

step Noboru the Cudgel
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Noboru wanders the clearing south-west of the Fallow Sanctuary; his cudgel starts a quest.
  kill 5477 @54.9,34.1
  collect 6196 "Noboru's Cudgel"
  accept 1392

step Draenethyst crystals
  tip Head north-east to the Fallow Sanctuary. The crystals stand along the way up to Galen Goodward's cage.
  collect 6071 x6 quest 1389.1          -- Draenethyst Crystals

step Galen's Escape
  tip Galen Goodward is held in the Fallow Sanctuary in the swamp's north-east. Free him and follow him out, fighting off the swamp creatures that chase him.
  accept 1393
  complete 1393

step Galen's Strongbox
  tip His strongbox waits at his old camp north of Stonard, on the way back west.
  turnin 1393

step The Harborage
  tip Head west along the road to the draenei camp at the Harborage, near the way in from Deadwind Pass.
  turnin 1392                           -- Magtoor
  turnin 1389

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Pool of Tears and Misty Reed Post

step Pool of Tears
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Back east along the road, past Stonard: the Atal'ai artifacts lie in the water and on the banks of the Pool of Tears. Only Sawfin Frenzies (38-40) swim there.
  collect 6175 quest 1424.1

step Misty Reed Post
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Follow the road south-east to the small Horde post on the shore: Tok'Kar takes the crocolisk flanks, and Katar stands beside him.
  turnin 698                            -- Tok'Kar
  accept 699

step Sawtooth snappers
  tip The Sawtooth Snappers (41-42) line the strand south of the post; nearly every one drops a claw. Leave the murlocs further along the shore for your next swamp visit.
  tip Careful: a Methuselah Crab (level 60) walks the south-east strand: give it a wide berth.
  collect 6168 quest 699.1

step Misty Reed Post
  turnin 699                            -- Tok'Kar
  accept 1422                           -- Tok'Kar
  turnin 1422                           -- Katar
  accept 1426                           -- Katar: the murlocs (41-44) wait for your next swamp visit

step Stonard
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Back north-west along the road to Stonard: Fel'zerul, on the top floor, takes the artifacts. Fresh Meat's crawlers and Katar's murlocs wait for your next swamp visit.
  turnin 1424                           -- Fel'zerul, on the top floor